Fonts bundled with OpenSplit, so that the app never fetches one from a
third-party host at runtime.

Instrument Sans and JetBrains Mono
    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    https://openfontlicense.org

    InstrumentSans-Regular.ttf, InstrumentSans-Medium.ttf,
    InstrumentSans-SemiBold.ttf and JetBrainsMono-Medium.ttf are the exact
    files package:google_fonts would otherwise download: each was fetched from
    the URL that package builds and checked against the SHA-256 and byte length
    recorded in its own font descriptors.

Roboto
    Not bundled. Flutter's web engine needs a font family named "Roboto" to
    exist or it downloads one from fonts.gstatic.com; pubspec.yaml satisfies
    that name with Instrument Sans, so no Roboto file ships with this app.
